%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4b3f2a8c8f344355b16a4d4296ae3f98, type: 3}
  m_Name: Rhino
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  vesselClass: 3
  entries:
  - Element: 1
    AbilityLabel: 'Carry'
    AbilityDescription: 'A thrown prism flies on past where the furrow lands it to strike the next one in its line, and a thrown prism that strikes another destroys both (prism motion). Charge sets how far it still reaches: 0 at rest (it strikes only what is in its way), 40 u at level 10, floored at 0, read at the replicated level so every peer strikes alike (RhinoPloughPrismEffect.carryDistance). A prism that strikes nothing still lands where the furrow puts it.'
    Input: 0
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: 'Avalanche'
    UpgradeDescription: 'A strike carries on: the next prism down the line within the carry is thrown on too, and its own strike can throw the next, up to 3 more (RhinoPloughPrismEffectSO.avalancheUpgradeElement, gated on IsUpgradeActive(Charge); Garrett, 2026-11-07).'
  - Element: 2
    AbilityLabel: 'Blade'
    AbilityDescription: 'A plough blade across the nose: one hull collider whose width follows Mass - 14 u at rest (a little wider than the hull), 40 u at level 10, floored at 10, read at the replicated level (RhinoPloughBlade.width). A wider blade catches more mass, and the plough throws what it catches clear of the whole blade.'
    Input: 0
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: 'Berm'
    UpgradeDescription: 'A ploughed prism LANDS SHIELDED, so the furrow banks into walls of armour; a prism that strikes another still breaks (RhinoPloughPrismEffectSO.bermUpgradeElement, gated on IsUpgradeActive(Mass); Garrett, 2026-11-07).'
  - Element: 3
    AbilityLabel: 'Furrow'
    AbilityDescription: 'How far aside the plough throws what the hull hits: Space adds 0 u at rest to 20 u at level 10 to every throw, at any speed, on top of the speed-driven throw (speed x 0.04 s, at most 30 u) (RhinoPloughPrismEffect.furrowDistance, replicated level). Pull a trigger for a little shove that way; HOLD it and everything the hull ploughs is thrown to that side, across the centreline (RhinoPloughSteerAction: LT left, RT right, the last one pulled wins). Let go and each prism goes to the side it already sat on.'
    Input: 1
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: 'Unstoppable'
    UpgradeDescription: 'The plough moves SUPER-shielded mass too; without it super-shielded prisms are the immovable tier and only jiggle (RhinoPloughPrismEffectSO.unstoppableUpgradeElement, gated on IsUpgradeActive(Space); Garrett, 2026-11-07). Arena linings and race tracks are super-shielded, so an upgraded Rhino can plough them out of line.'
  - Element: 4
    AbilityLabel: 'Ramp Spool'
    AbilityDescription: 'Time raises how fast the ramp boost winds the Rhino up to its top speed: 220 u/s per second at rest, 550 at level 10, 110 at the -5 floor (RampBoostActionSO.timeAccelerationMultiplier, x1 -> x2.5, floored x0.5, read live). It does not raise the ceiling - cruise 50 x maxBoostMultiplier 16.8 = 840 u/s - only how long the run-up takes. The Rhino is a bulldozer: its hull carries no prism slow, so ramming mass costs it no speed - the plough shoves what it hits aside (RhinoPloughPrismEffectSO) and the ramp keeps climbing through it.'
    Input: 0
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: 'Momentum'
    UpgradeDescription: 'Above 70% of top speed (588 u/s) danger prisms cannot drain the Rhino''s elements - the elemental-debuff ward scoped to DangerPrism alone, so an opposing pilot''s blast still lands (VesselElementalImmunity on the root, condition WhileAboveTopSpeedFraction, upgradeGate Time). The Time card lights while the ward is holding.'
  omniAbilityLabel: 
